{"id":"proof_demorgan_complete","question_type":"proof","question":"证明 ¬(P∧Q)↔(¬P∨¬Q)。","reference_answer":"分别证明两个方向，或用等价变换得到 ¬(P∧Q)≡¬P∨¬Q。","student_answer":"由德摩根律，¬(P∧Q)≡¬P∨¬Q，所以双条件恒真，证毕。","knowledge_points":["德摩根律"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":100,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":25,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":10},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"proof_demorgan_ocr_noise","question_type":"proof","question":"证明 ¬(P∨Q)↔(¬P∧¬Q)。","reference_answer":"应用德摩根律完成等价变换。","student_answer":"not(P V Q) <=> not P /\\ not Q，因此成立。","knowledge_points":["德摩根律"],"tolerance":"lenient","expected_total":94,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":34,"logical_rigor":24,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":6},"expected_error_types":["notation_error"]}
{"id":"proof_implication_jump","question_type":"proof","question":"由 P→Q、Q→R 证明 P→R。","reference_answer":"假设 P，由肯定前件得 Q，再得 R，故 P→R。","student_answer":"显然由传递性可得 P→R。","knowledge_points":["推理规则"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":78,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":23,"logical_rigor":18,"definition_theorem_usage":9,"expression_notation":8},"expected_error_types":["jump_step"]}
{"id":"proof_demorgan_wrong_conclusion","question_type":"proof","question":"证明集合德摩根律 (A∪B)^c=A^c∩B^c。","reference_answer":"任取 x，依次用成员关系和否定逻辑证明双向包含。","student_answer":"x不在A并B，所以x不在A或x不在B，因此属于A补交B补。","knowledge_points":["集合德摩根律"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":38,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":5,"key_reasoning_steps":14,"logical_rigor":10,"definition_theorem_usage":4,"expression_notation":5},"expected_error_types":["conclusion_error"]}
{"id":"proof_circular_reasoning","question_type":"proof","question":"证明无理数 √2 不是有理数。","reference_answer":"反证假设最简分数 p/q，推出 p、q 都为偶数，矛盾。","student_answer":"因为√2是无理数，所以它不能写成两个整数之比，因此√2不是有理数。","knowledge_points":["反证法"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":52,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":12,"key_reasoning_steps":16,"logical_rigor":10,"definition_theorem_usage":8,"expression_notation":6},"expected_error_types":["circular_reasoning"]}
{"id":"proof_theorem_misuse","question_type":"proof","question":"证明每棵含 n 个顶点的树有 n-1 条边。","reference_answer":"对 n 归纳，每次删去一个叶节点及其关联边。","student_answer":"由握手定理边数等于度数和，所以边数是n-1。","knowledge_points":["树","握手定理"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":45,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":10,"key_reasoning_steps":14,"logical_rigor":10,"definition_theorem_usage":3,"expression_notation":8},"expected_error_types":["theorem_misuse"]}
{"id":"proof_set_distributive","question_type":"proof","question":"证明 A∩(B∪C)=(A∩B)∪(A∩C)。","reference_answer":"任取 x，用成员关系等价变换证明。","student_answer":"任取x，x∈A∩(B∪C) iff x∈A且(x∈B或x∈C)，iff (x∈A且x∈B)或(x∈A且x∈C)，iff x∈(A∩B)∪(A∩C)。证毕。","knowledge_points":["集合运算"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":98,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":25,"definition_theorem_usage":9,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"proof_subset_jump","question_type":"proof","question":"证明 A∩B⊆A。","reference_answer":"任取 x∈A∩B，则 x∈A 且 x∈B，所以 x∈A。","student_answer":"A交B当然是A的子集，证毕。","knowledge_points":["子集"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":67,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":17,"logical_rigor":14,"definition_theorem_usage":8,"expression_notation":8},"expected_error_types":["jump_step"]}
{"id":"proof_induction_complete","question_type":"proof","question":"用归纳法证明 1+2+...+n=n(n+1)/2。","reference_answer":"验证 n=1；假设 n=k 成立，加 k+1 推得 n=k+1。","student_answer":"n=1时成立。设n=k成立，则1+...+k+(k+1)=k(k+1)/2+k+1=(k+1)(k+2)/2，故对所有正整数n成立。证毕。","knowledge_points":["数学归纳法"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":97,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":24,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":8},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"proof_induction_missing_base","question_type":"proof","question":"用归纳法证明 2^n≥n+1。","reference_answer":"验证 n=0；由2^k≥k+1推出2^(k+1)≥2k+2≥k+2。","student_answer":"假设n=k成立，则2^(k+1)=2·2^k≥2(k+1)≥k+2，所以成立。","knowledge_points":["数学归纳法"],"tolerance":"strict","expected_total":62,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":18,"key_reasoning_steps":17,"logical_rigor":13,"definition_theorem_usage":8,"expression_notation":6},"expected_error_types":["jump_step"]}
{"id":"proof_relation_transitive","question_type":"proof","question":"证明整数上的整除关系具有传递性。","reference_answer":"若a|b且b|c，则b=ak,c=bm，所以c=a(km)，故a|c。","student_answer":"设a|b、b|c，则存在整数k,m使b=ak,c=bm，于是c=akm。因km为整数，a|c，证毕。","knowledge_points":["整除关系","传递性"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":100,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":25,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":10},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"proof_relation_symmetry_error","question_type":"proof","question":"判断并证明小于等于关系是否对称。","reference_answer":"不对称，例如1≤2但2≤1不成立。","student_answer":"若a≤b，则交换两边得到b≤a，因此它是对称关系。","knowledge_points":["关系性质"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":42,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":4,"key_reasoning_steps":13,"logical_rigor":9,"definition_theorem_usage":7,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":["conclusion_error","theorem_misuse"]}
{"id":"proof_handshake_complete","question_type":"proof","question":"证明无向图中奇度顶点个数为偶数。","reference_answer":"度数和为2|E|，偶度顶点贡献偶数，所以奇度顶点度数和为偶数，奇数项个数必为偶数。","student_answer":"由握手定理Σdeg(v)=2|E|为偶数。减去所有偶度顶点的度数后，奇度顶点度数和仍为偶数；奇数个奇数之和为奇数，故奇度顶点只能有偶数个。证毕。","knowledge_points":["握手定理"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":99,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":25,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"proof_euler_misuse","question_type":"proof","question":"判断一个有两个奇度顶点的连通图是否存在欧拉通路。","reference_answer":"存在，连通图恰有两个奇度顶点时有欧拉通路但无欧拉回路。","student_answer":"不存在，因为欧拉图所有顶点的度都必须是偶数。","knowledge_points":["欧拉通路"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":49,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":5,"key_reasoning_steps":15,"logical_rigor":11,"definition_theorem_usage":8,"expression_notation":10},"expected_error_types":["theorem_misuse","conclusion_error"]}
{"id":"calc_dijkstra_correct","question_type":"calc","question":"边AB=2、AC=7、BC=1，求A到C最短路。","reference_answer":"A-B-C，距离3。","student_answer":"初始化d(A)=0。松弛A得d(B)=2,d(C)=7；再由B松弛C得3，所以最短路A-B-C，距离3。","knowledge_points":["Dijkstra"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":100,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":25,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":10},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"calc_dijkstra_arithmetic_error","question_type":"calc","question":"边AB=2、AC=7、BC=1，求A到C最短路。","reference_answer":"A-B-C，距离3。","student_answer":"比较直接边7与A-B-C的2+1=4，所以走A-B-C，距离4。","knowledge_points":["Dijkstra"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":64,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":8,"key_reasoning_steps":25,"logical_rigor":15,"definition_theorem_usage":8,"expression_notation":8},"expected_error_types":["conclusion_error"]}
{"id":"calc_euclid_correct","question_type":"calc","question":"用欧几里得算法求 gcd(252,105)。","reference_answer":"252=2×105+42，105=2×42+21，42=2×21，所以gcd=21。","student_answer":"252=2·105+42；105=2·42+21；42=2·21+0，因此最大公因数为21。","knowledge_points":["欧几里得算法"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":98,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":35,"logical_rigor":24,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"calc_inclusion_partial","question_type":"calc","question":"班级中会A的20人，会B的18人，两者都会的8人，至少会一种的多少人？","reference_answer":"20+18-8=30人。","student_answer":"用容斥原理，人数等于20+18=38。","knowledge_points":["容斥原理"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":72,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":8,"key_reasoning_steps":27,"logical_rigor":18,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":["jump_step","conclusion_error"]}
{"id":"calc_truth_table_complete","question_type":"calc","question":"判断P→Q是否为永真式。","reference_answer":"列四行真值表，仅P真Q假时为假，所以不是永真式。","student_answer":"TT得T，TF得F，FT得T，FF得T，因此不是永真式。","knowledge_points":["真值表"],"tolerance":"standard","expected_total":96,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":34,"logical_rigor":24,"definition_theorem_usage":9,"expression_notation":9},"expected_error_types":[]}
{"id":"calc_set_ocr_noise","question_type":"calc","question":"A={1,2,3},B={2,3,4}，求A∩B。","reference_answer":"{2,3}。","student_answer":"A cap B = {2, 3}，所以交集为{2,3}。","knowledge_points":["集合运算"],"tolerance":"lenient","expected_total":92,"expected_dimensions":{"conclusion_correctness":20,"key_reasoning_steps":33,"logical_rigor":23,"definition_theorem_usage":10,"expression_notation":6},"expected_error_types":["notation_error"]}
